<title>PORTUGAL: PORTUCEL RAISING PULP PRICES FROM MAY 1.</title>
<headline>PORTUCEL RAISING PULP PRICES FROM MAY 1.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese pulp producer Portucel Industrial said on Monday that it was raising pulp prices to 450 ecu per tonne from 400 ecu previously with effect from May 1.</p>
</text>
